        "original_id": "77594ceb-2487-5227-8c27-5d0e79b4e420",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: 2Pac, Yaki Kadafi, Kastro, Young Noble, Prince Ital Joe\n- Groups: The Outlawz, Dramacydal\n- Songs: \"Hail Mary\"\n\nFacts:\n- Yafeu Akiyele Fula was born on October 9, 1977, and he was better known by the stage name Yaki Kadafi.\n- Yaki Kadafi was an American rapper and a founder and member of the rap groups Outlawz and Dramacydal.\n- 2Pac died in September 1996.\n- Yaki Kadafi died on November 10, 1996.\n- The song \"Hail Mary\" was released after 2Pac's September 1996 death.\n- The song \"Hail Mary\" features rap verses by Kastro, Young Noble, and Yaki Kadafi of The Outlawz, as well as Prince Ital Joe.",
